"speaker": "The Hermit",
"text": "The Crown was never meant to be worn. It binds what it touches... and what it touches, it hollows."
}, {
"speaker": "The Hermit",
"text": "If you must reach it, know this: every path here is sealed until you earn the means to open it."
}, {
"speaker": "The Hermit",
"text": "Press on, ashen one. The gate ahead will not move for empty hands."
}]

